Enforce IMDSv2 (disable IMDSv1): aws ec2 modify-instance-metadata-options --instance-id i-xxx --http-tokens required
Set hop limit to 1: -http-put-response-hop-limit 1
Use VPC endpoints to prevent SSRF to IMDS
Implement network-level controls (iptables rules)
Monitor CloudTrail for unusual API calls from EC2 instances
